Fixes:
- Key repeated rows by their place in the list, so two rows with the same text both draw and keep their own state.
- A row with no before value printed +0%, and a legend with fewer than two names drew empty swatches; the chip now needs a change it can compute or one written in the row, and the legend shows only named series.

